  "releaseNotes": "* Updated code to use Argument Exception throwing polyfills (#210) and address nullability warnings \n* Added the ``NoValidation`` static instance property to the ``ProcessExitConfiguration`` class - This provides a static helper instance property with no exit code validation, no timeout validation, and suppresses exceptions where possible.\n* Updated ``RunnerProcessInvokerBase`` methods to be virtual\n* Updated ``ProcessNotSuccessfulException`` Process code to use new ProcessExceptionInfo`` class instead of ``Process`` class\n* Fixed an incorrect copyright notice header showing Copyright DotPrimitives instead of CliInvoke",
